				</IHandle>
			</m_pModelObject>
			<m_pParent type="s">GUID ba5121a0-5021-42bd-bcc6-90f47de6b2e8</m_pParent>
			<m_name type="p">
				<CGIText type="e">
					<m_str type="a">When creating a flow, it is contained in the source element (system or function). If the source element is read only, then the flow is created in the target element (system or function). If the target element is read only, then the flow is created in the first writable package in the owner tree.%0D
During operational analysis, the SOI is always writable, during logical analysis, the user can creates flows between read only logical components, during technical analysis, the user can creates flows between technical components. It is also possible to creates flows in interface management packages between read only systems.%0D
%0D
</m_str>
					<m_style type="a">Arial; 10 0 0 0 1 </m_style>
					<m_color type="p">
						<IColor type="e">
							<m_fgColor type="a">0</m_fgColor>
							<m_bgColor type="a">0</m_bgColor>
