			<m_name type="p">
				<CGIText type="e">
					<m_str type="a">The State Chart element in Rhapsody automatically contains a state chart diagram named  &quot;statechart + diagram&quot; when created,the Diagram suffix was removed to avoid the &quot;DiagramDiagram&quot; display in the diagram name.%0D
However the diagram toolbar is associated to the OperatingModeChart stereotype%0D
Note: can't add states or operating modes from the browser</m_str>
					<m_style type="a">Arial; 10 0 0 0 1 </m_style>
